WEBVTT

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:16.250
Kagami ni senaka mukete ayumu hodo ni toozakaru yume yo 
Back to the mirror, my dream getting farther with every step I take

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:20.920
Massugu kimi to mukiaitai 
I want to come face-to-face with you

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:27.420
Dekinai jibun e to "never mind" 
Saying to the incapable version of myself, "never mind"

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:35.190
Ahiru no Sora

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:41.290
Nagare sagyou de waketeyuku yume 
A dream slowly dismantled on the assembly line

00:01:42.170 --> 00:01:44.540
Muki? Fumuki? Iwaba rongai? 
(Suitable? Unsuitable? Pretty much impossible?)

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:49.000
Koe mo naku kietetta koe 
True feelings gone missing without a whisper

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:52.000
Tameiki sura denai 
(Not even capable of a sigh)

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:58.170
Hito no sei ni shitatte owarenai 
None of it will end by placing the blame on others

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:02.130
Me no mae ni kiritatta ima 
Right now, in the face of a steep slope

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:06.170
"Koetai" to kokoro ga sakenderu 
My heart cries out for me to "overcome it"

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:13.750
Dekinai wake o sagasu nara daredemo dekiru sa 
Finding excuses not to try is something that anybody can do

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:21.290
Agaki hashitta sono saki mada shiranai jibun to deau 
Pushing myself to run beyond, I went to meet a me I've never known

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:27.630
Kabe ni kizamikonda rakugaki to "never mind" 
There's graffiti etched on the wall that says "never mind"

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:31.750
Ima asu e to hazume 
Now, I bounce into tomorrow

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:44.350
Versus

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:02.100
Kitasumiyoshi

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:02.100
Kuzuryu

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.900
Kuzuryu

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.900
Kitasumiyoshi

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.320
Kuzuryu

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.320
Kitasumiyoshi

00:22:13.170 --> 00:22:18.090
Hitori ja umaku ikanaku temo 
Even if things aren't going well on my own

00:22:18.630 --> 00:22:22.290
Kikkake nante tanjun sa 
There's a simple way to turn it all around

00:22:24.210 --> 00:22:29.250
Mienai deguchi ni hikaru ga sashite 
A light falls down on an exit previously unseen

00:22:29.710 --> 00:22:33.420
Asu wa soko ni arunda 
That's where the path to tomorrow lies

00:22:34.170 --> 00:22:40.130
Hitori nanka ja nakatta 
I was never really alone to begin with

00:22:40.130 --> 00:22:45.290
Kono me ni utsuru keshiki no naka ni 
You were in the scenery reflected in my eyes

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:51.790
Kimi ga ireba doko made datte ikeru sa 
I can go anywhere so long as you stay there

00:22:51.790 --> 00:22:56.670
Kitto genkai nante nainda 
There are no such things as limits

00:22:56.670 --> 00:23:01.840
Kimi to ireba tsuyoku narunda 
Just having you by my side makes me stronger

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:08.920
Nando demo tachiagatte susunde ikou 
We'll pick ourselves up as often as needed and keep moving

00:23:09.040 --> 00:23:16.960
Oh oh oh, oh oh oh, oh oh oh,

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:19.920
Saigo no ichibyou made 
Until the very last second

00:23:20.130 --> 00:23:22.750
Akiramenaide busukatte 
Don't give up and keep fighting

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:29.840
Kono michi no saki wa kanarazu kagayaiteru kara 
A shining light is undoubtedly waiting for us down this path

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:35.390
Ahiru no Sora

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:35.390
Next Time: Now...
